    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the agriculture and markets law, in relation to the inspection and sale of industrial hemp seeds, the support of the industrial hemp industry and the inclusion of industrial hemp as a crop",
    "basePrintNo": "S6787",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S6787-2017",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
      {
